        <div class="ensemble-member__body">
          <p class="ensemble-member__role">Flute &middot; Executive Director</p>
          <h3 class="ensemble-member__name">Guillermo Laporta</h3>
          <p class="ensemble-member__bio">
            Flutist, composer, and multimedia creator, Guillermo Laporta is the Executive Director of CreArtBox and Festival ADAR. At the heart of his practice lies the concept of the "visual concert" - multimedia performances that weave visual art and theatrical design into live chamber music. His work has been praised by <em>The New Yorker</em>, <em>Time Out</em>, and <em>Broadway World</em> for its "wholly authentic, visually and aurally compelling experience."
          </p>
          <ul class="ensemble-member__highlights">
            <li>Executive Director, CreArtBox</li>
            <li>Executive Director, Festival ADAR</li>
